联弱抗强的汉室兴复方略。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":17630,"turn":2,"type":"decision_revealed","factionId":"wu","message":"吴：江东初定，建业当兴商以厚府库。已与蜀汉约为唇齿，共御曹公；魏使之事，权以为交浅言深，容后再议。 决策理由：建业为都城尚无专精，先定商贸充实金库以备军用。外交上拒魏盟而纳蜀盟，延续联弱抗强之策，呼应孙刘联盟之基。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":17631,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀接受了 吴 的结盟提议"},{"id":17632,"turn":2,"type":"joint_attack_proposed","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 向 吴 提议共同进攻 魏"},{"id":17633,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"wu","message":"吴拒绝了 魏 的结盟提议"},{"id":17634,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"wu","message":"吴接受了 蜀 的结盟提议"},{"id":17635,"turn":2,"type":"develop_city","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 将汉中建设为军镇专精 1 级"},{"id":17636,"turn":2,"type":"develop_city","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 将建业建设为商贸专精 1 级"},{"id":17637,"turn":2,"type":"transfer","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 从洛阳向宛城调动 7 兵力","payload":{"sourceCityId":"luoyang","targetCityId":"wancheng","troops":7}},{"id":17638,"turn":3,"type":"diplomacy_changed","factionId":null,"message":"蜀 与 吴 的关系变为同盟"},{"id":17639,"turn":3,"type":"turn_prepared","factionId":null,"message":"第 3 回合（蓄势阶段）收入与维持已结算"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-17T14:29:45.512Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-17T14:31:38.680Z","exportedAt":"2026-08-17T14:32:06.720Z"}